ink\">UCAT</a><a data-w-id=\"6c74eb2d-7182-dd69-094d-a3655c037506\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Graduate_Record_Examinations\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"dropdown-link-7 w-dropdown-link\">GRE</a><a data-w-id=\"97e13e55-913a-c73f-1469-5d3056fe800a\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Graduate_Management_Admission_Test\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"dropdown-link-7 w-dropdown-link\">GMAT</a><a data-w-id=\"58f93b41-0a9f-33fe-6bfc-f8dd3b59c479\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/European_Union_of_Medical_Specialists\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"dropdown-link-7 w-dropdown-link\">UEMS</a><a data-w-id=\"f53e61ec-7bd3-f0d0-a005-99e8171db16d\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Baccalaureate\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"dropdown-link-7 w-dropdown-link\">IB</a><a data-w-id=\"813f04e6-f10c-fd79-ceaf-04fccd2ca8de\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Advanced_Placement\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"dropdown-link-7 w-dropdown-link\">AP</a></nav></div></div><div id=\"w-node-_05d0023e-f06c-50f0-7ea3-558eecf113b0-87f98ca6\" class=\"nav_menu-link-wrap\"><a href=\"/packages\" class=\"nav_link w-inline-block\"><div class=\"text-block-4\">Our Packages</div><div class=\"link_line\" style=\"transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px) scale3d(0, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg, 0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;\"></div></a><div data-hover=\"false\" data-delay=\"0\" class=\"w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle-2 w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"icon-60 w-icon-dropdown-toggle\"></div><div class=\"text-block-4\">Resources</div></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list-2 w-dropdown-list\"><a data-w-id=\"5981bf90-84e7-96f6-6983-121ab8e52203\" href=\"/webiners\" class=\"dropdown-link-5 w-dropdown-link\">Webiners</a><a data-w-id=\"5981bf90-84e7-96f6-6983-121ab8e52205\" href=\"/tutorials\" class=\"dropdown-link-6 w-dropdown-link\">Tutorials</a><a data-w-id=\"5981bf90-84e7-96f6-6983-121ab8e52207\" href=\"/coming-soon\" class=\"dropdown-link-7 w-dropdown-link\">Podcast</a><a data-w-id=\"5981bf90-84e7-96f6-6983-121ab8e52209\" href=\"/blogs\" class=\"dropdown-link-7 w-dropdown-link\">Blog</a></nav></div><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"nav_link w-inline-block\"><div class=\"text-block-6\">CONTACT US</div><div class=\"link_line\" style=\"transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px) scale3d(0, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg, 0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;\"></div></a></div></div></nav><a href=\"http://wa.me/971522732589\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link-block-2 w-inline-block\"><div class=\"text-block-11\">Whatsapp</div></a><div class=\"nav_button w-nav-button\"><div class=\"nav_button-inner\"><div class=\"nav_button-line is-top\"></div><div class=\"nav_button-line is-middle\"></div><div class=\"nav_button-line is-bottom\"></div></div></div></div></div></div><main class=\"main-wrapper\"><section data-w-id=\"dac3a0ad-1bc4-f50d-4480-37c180ea2f7d\" class=\"section is-about-hero\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"about-hero_wrap\"><div class=\"max-width-700\"><h1 class=\"heading-style-h1\"> </h1></div><div class=\"about-visual_wrap\"><div class=\"video_box\"><div class=\"video_bg\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/695f5a9694b6251c39f9ae98_Turksih%20copy%202.png\" loading=\"eager\" sizes=\"239.9765625px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/695f5a9694b6251c39f9ae98_Turksih%20copy%202-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/695f5a9694b6251c39f9ae98_Turksih%20copy%202-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/695f5a9694b6251c39f9ae98_Turksih%20copy%202-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/695f5a9694b6251c39f9ae98_Turksih%20copy%202.png 1275w\" alt=\"\" class=\"parallax-img is-full\" style=\"will-change: transform; transform: translate3d(0px, 0%, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg, 0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"w-layout-vflex flex-center\"><div class=\"max-width-800\"><p><strong>Our Turkish language program is designed to help students integrate into Turkish daily life, pursue university studies, or build careers in Türkiye. The curriculum follows modern European teaching standards and focuses on practical skills to ensure strong communication abilities.</strong></p></div></div></div></div></section><section data-w-id=\"edacf3db-d746-a07d-9d0a-ba32c805a8af\" class=\"section is-history\"><div class=\"parallax-wrap\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/6921f6d4d003b8bd6fcd7473_turkish-language-history.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/6921f6d4d003b8bd6fcd7473_turkish-language-history-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/6921f6d4d003b8bd6fcd7473_turkish-language-history-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/6921f6d4d003b8bd6fcd7473_turkish-language-history-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/6921f6d4d003b8bd6fcd7473_turkish-language-history.jpg 1600w\" alt=\"\" class=\"parallax-img\" style=\"will-change: transform; transform: translate3d(0px, 0%, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg, 0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;\"><div class=\"parallax-overlay is-full\"></div></div><div class=\"z-index-2\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div data-w-id=\"a41fac32-d451-d387-ddeb-f99c2df28067\" class=\"wrap_flex is-align-top\"><div class=\"max-width-440\"></div><div class=\"max-width-440 is-full-responsive\"></div><div class=\"max-width-440\"><h2><span class=\"is-word is-1\">What You Will Learn</span></h2></div><div class=\"max-width-440 is-full-responsive\"><div class=\"text-color-lightgrey\"><p><strong class=\"bold-text-3\">- Everyday conversations and fluent communication in real-life situations.<br><br>- Essential Turkish grammar explained in a clear and simple way.<br><br>- Reading and understanding texts from beginner to advanced levels.<br><br>- Writing skills for messages, essays, and formal communication.<br><br>- Extensive vocabulary related to university life, travel, and work.</strong></p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section background-color-black\"><div data-w-id=\"2868c035-7512-59ff-d96d-180201f9bdc9\" class=\"container-large\"></div><section class=\"section background-color-black\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"faqs_wrap\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><div class=\"w-layout-vflex max-width-440\"><div class=\"margin-bottom-16\"><h2 class=\"is-word is-1\">FAQ</h2></div></div></div><ul role=\"list\" class=\"faqs_list\"><li data-w-id=\"ab1a3d19-977b-898b-3bc1-40074489c468\" class=\"faqs_item\"><div class=\"faqs_head\"><p class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-medium\">What type of learning materials do you use in the Turkish language courses?</p><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/68fd63e9503df62b019b5ca9_faq-arrow.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-24\"></div><div class=\"faqs_body\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 0px;\"><div class=\"margin-top-8\"><div class=\"text-color-lightgrey\"><div class=\"text-rich-text w-richtext\"><p>We use certified and regularly updated learning materials that follow international language-teaching standards and the European Framework (CEFR). Our materials include textbooks, digital resources, audio recordings, and practical exercises designed to strengthen all language skills. These resources are carefully selected to ensure students learn Turkish efficiently and stay up to date with the latest linguistic and cultural developments in Türkiye.</p></div></div></div></div></li><li data-w-id=\"ab1a3d19-977b-898b-3bc1-40074489c468\" class=\"faqs_item\"><div class=\"faqs_head\"><p class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-medium\">How are the classes structured, and what makes them interactive?</p><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/68fd63e9503df62b019b5ca9_faq-arrow.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-24\"></div><div class=\"faqs_body\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 0px;\"><div class=\"margin-top-8\"><div class=\"text-color-lightgrey\"><div class=\"text-rich-text w-richtext\"><p>Our classes are designed to be highly interactive and centered around real-world communication. Students actively participate in conversations, role-plays, situational dialogues, and practical activities that simulate everyday life in Türkiye. This approach allows learners to build confidence quickly, use the language naturally, and develop communication skills that go beyond memorizing vocabulary and grammar.</p></div></div></div></div></li><li data-w-id=\"ab1a3d19-977b-898b-3bc1-40074489c468\" class=\"faqs_item\"><div class=\"faqs_head\"><p class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-medium\">Who teaches the Turkish courses, and are the instructors native speakers?</p><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/68fd63e9503df62b019b5ca9_faq-arrow.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-24\"></div><div class=\"faqs_body\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 0px;\"><div class=\"margin-top-8\"><div class=\"text-color-lightgrey\"><div class=\"text-rich-text w-richtext\"><p>All our Turkish language courses are taught by native Turkish-speaking instructors with extensive experience in teaching Turkish to international students. Their deep understanding of the language and culture allows them to explain concepts clearly, offer authentic pronunciation guidance, and provide cultural insights that help students communicate effectively in real situations.</p></div></div></div></div></li><li data-w-id=\"ab1a3d19-977b-898b-3bc1-40074489c468\" class=\"faqs_item\"><div class=\"faqs_head\"><p class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-medium\">What levels do you offer, and can beginners join the program?</p><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/68fd63e9503df62b019b5ca9_faq-arrow.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-24\"></div><div class=\"faqs_body\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 0px;\"><div class=\"margin-top-8\"><div class=\"text-color-lightgrey\"><div class=\"text-rich-text w-richtext\"><p>Yes, beginners are welcome. We offer courses for all proficiency levels, from <strong>A1 to C1</strong>. Whether students are starting from zero or aiming to achieve advanced fluency, each level includes structured lessons, practical exercises, and clear learning objectives. Learners progress step-by-step through reading, writing, listening, speaking, and grammar until they reach their desired level of mastery.</p></div></div></div></div></li><li data-w-id=\"ab1a3d19-977b-898b-3bc1-40074489c468\" class=\"faqs_item\"><div class=\"faqs_head\"><p class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-medium\">Do you provide support for students who want to study at Turkish universities?</p><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/68fd63e9503df62b019b5ca9_faq-arrow.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-24\"></div><div class=\"faqs_body\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 0px;\"><div class=\"margin-top-8\"><div class=\"text-color-lightgrey\"><div class=\"text-rich-text w-richtext\"><p>Absolutely. We offer full support for students intending to apply to universities in Türkiye. This includes guidance on required language certificates such as TÖMER, assistance with application procedures, exam preparation for YÖS, and personalized advice on choosing the right academic programs. Our dedicated team ensures that students are fully prepared linguistically and academically for their university journey.</p></div></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><h1 class=\"heading-style-h1\"> </h1><h1><span class=\"is-word\">Contact Us</span></h1><p class=\"paragraph-4\">Ready to start? Fill out the form below:</p><a data-w-id=\"0e1189d4-76f3-376f-44ec-171f1131fbfc\" href=\"#\" class=\"button-2 w-button\">Fill the form</a></div></section></section><section data-w-id=\"4500f34f-ad71-c737-340f-a39b6520a855\" class=\"section is-bottom-cta\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div data-w-id=\"4500f34f-ad71-c737-340f-a39b6520a857\" class=\"bottom-cta_wrap\"><div class=\"max-width-700\"><h2 class=\"heading-4\"><span class=\"is-word is-1\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, 0.5em, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg, 0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;\">ARE YOU Ready ?</span> <br></h2></div><div class=\"bottom-cta_box\" style=\"will-change: transform; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px) scale3d(2.5, 2.5, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg, 0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;\"><div class=\"video_bg\"><div class=\"video_bg_overlay\"></div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/68fd63e9503df62b019b5d1a_reading-room.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 307px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/68fd63e9503df62b019b5d1a_reading-room-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/68fd63e9503df62b019b5d1a_reading-room.webp 640w\" alt=\"Bright, spacious reading room with tall windows, rows of study desks, and people working quietly.\" class=\"img-cover\"></div></div><div class=\"max-width-full\"></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"section is-footer\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"margin-bottom-64\"><div class=\"wrap_flex is-align-top\"><div class=\"max-width-250\"><div class=\"margin-bottom-8\"><p class=\"heading-style-h5\">UniStation Destinations</p></div><p><strong>Top Destinations:</strong><br>US, Canada, UK, Ireland, Australia, New Zealand<br><strong>‍<br>Budget-Frien